WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Read the instructions and watch the demo, then choose Enter RC Training.

00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
Choose a single passage or full section. Select Start passage.

00:11.000 --> 00:16.000
Choose Start exercise and allow the microphone. Practice requires recording. The paragraph appears once recording starts.

00:16.000 --> 00:25.000
Read the whole paragraph. Put each idea into your own words in your head. The visible passage timer counts up. Press Space or Hide paragraph.

00:25.000 --> 00:32.000
Explain the hidden paragraph aloud from memory. Press Space or Check recall. Recording continues.

00:32.000 --> 00:39.000
Compare your explanation with the source. Choose Next paragraph, or Finish passage after its final paragraph.

00:39.000 --> 00:44.000
Finish passage saves the completed passage time. Whole-passage recall is optional.

00:44.000 --> 00:49.000
The passage list shows saved completion and last passage time. This example time is illustrative. Older records without timing show time unavailable.

00:49.000 --> 01:00.000
Choose Get feedback on my recall after saving. Illustrative feedback explains changed qualifications. Source units earn 2 points for complete meaning, 1 for partial, or 0 for missing or changed meaning. Only hidden recall speech is graded. AI assessment, not an LSAT score.
